\">6月7日（周二）18:10〜19:30</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n将通过直播服务\n\nLINE LIVE\n\n进行\n\n播出哦！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n今年的电影\n\n《波尔凯尼恩与机巧的玛机雅娜》\n\n中将作为礼物送出的\n\n由大家投票选出的宝可梦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3895109/002-ab4c083a13.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3895109/002-ab4c083a13.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"487\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n720只宝可梦之巅\n\n<br>\n\n\n闪耀着荣耀光芒的第1名\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3895109/003-bc437a78af.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3895109/003-bc437a78af.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"707\" height=\"338\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n究竟是哪只宝可梦呢？\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n以及\n\n增田投票的可达鸭呢？（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n出演嘉宾有<br>\n \n\n中川翔子女士・佐香智久\n\n松本梨香女士\n\n<br>\n\n\n以及……<br>\n \n\n宝可梦公司社长\n\n石原先生\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.creatures.co.jp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Creatures公司</a>社长\n\n田中先生\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n增田\n\n\n将登台！\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon-movie.jp/election/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">宝可梦总选举720</a><a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon-movie.jp/election/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">结果公布典礼</a>\n\n详情请点击↑！<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n会变成什么样子呢\n满心都是不安\n不过（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n感觉会成为相当\n稀有的影像！\n就像增田的 egg 脸一样\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n所以说……\n大家一定要看哦（笑）\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n\nLINE的应用\n\negg可以变成动物和各种角色\n\n不仅能拍照片，也能拍视频！\n\n太棒了！\n（不是宣传（笑））","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-